# {{ package_name }}

A simple [Satellite](https://github.com/Arch-Network/satellite) program for Arch Network.

Program ID: `{{ program_id_base58 }}`

## Build

```bash
cargo build-sbf
```

Satellite IDL generation requires Rust nightly:

```bash
rustup toolchain install nightly
```

The `say_hello` instruction requires one user signer and logs
`Hello <USER_BASE58_PUBKEY>`.
